> items to prevent this, but is it 100% proof against corroding ? Its not
> a good solution anyway, because the grease soon wears off? And any
> weapon you grease gets constantly dropped - not good while in a battle.

Reading a cursed scroll of destroy armor while confused will proof
armor against rusting/burning/corroding, but will not fix any damage
already done.  Reading blessed/uncursed srolls of enchant weapon or
enchant armor while confused will proof the respective item types and
fix any damage that has already occurred.

Hope that is of some help.


